<title>BELGIUM: Belgian bonds up on Bunds slightly ahead U.S. data.</title>
<headline>Belgian bonds up on Bunds slightly ahead U.S. data.</headline>
<text>
<p>1030 GMT - Belgian bonds steady higher at midday ahead U.S. trade and weekly jobless data at 1230 GMT and French Prime</p>
<p>Minister Jospin's speech at 1300 GMT. Bund spread tighter.</p>
<p>*2007 OLO 5.78% (5.80) BE286=, 7 bps over Bunds (8)  MEUR</p>
<p>*OLO fut +0.06 at 122.20 BGBc1 ;Mark/Bfr 20.6345/60(20.6342/47)</p>
<p>*3-mo bill 3.23/26% (23/26), 1-wk repo 3.26/29 (26/30) </p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
